        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → BytePlus → BytePlus settings**.\n2. Describe your character in **Character**, and what they do and say in **Scene**. Put spoken words in double quotation marks.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/byteplus`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
