      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 mini starts on the character and makes a five-second 480p video with sound, speaking the line.\n\nModelArk usually starts the task at once, so a cancelled run's video is still made and billed. Collect it with **video-05-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
